<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - CPI, Insolvencies.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - CPI, Insolvencies.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Final CPI	   Jan	   +0.3 pct m/m	    Feb 17</p>
<p> Insolvencies	Nov 96	 +22 pct y/y	    Feb 18-19</p>
<p> Wholesale prices  Jan	   +0.3 pct m/m	    Feb 19-20</p>
<p> Import prices     Jan	   +0.8 pct m/m	    Feb 21-24</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
